OL,3,GNEWSAMajor road shut in city for
OL,4,Aupgrades reopens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major traffic route in Oxford has
OL,7,Freopened following multiple delays and
OL,8,Frising costs.
OL,10,FBotley Road, a main route into the city
OL,11,Fcentre, had been shut to traffic since
OL,12,FApril 2023 so that Network Rail could
OL,13,Fcarry out work to upgrade Oxford
OL,14,Frailway station, which the company said
OL,15,Fwas near to full capacity.
OL,17,FThe route was closed at the rail bridge
OL,18,Fbecause of the scheme, which saw costs
OL,19,Frise from #161m to #237.4m.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
